import ../../../testing/driver.dl

document replacement test:
    editor "Source" containing "abcd" using no UI appearance

set instance to an instance of replacement test
set view to a UI view of (the address of instance) sized 300 by 200 using font "regular" with the test UI driver
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 258 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
queue UI input of kind 3 key 263 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's selection's caret = 2) reporting "The test did not place its initial caret"
set the text of "Source" in (the address of instance) to "😀"
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((view's selection's anchor = 0) and (view's selection's caret = 0)) reporting "Replacing a source left its caret inside a Unicode character"
queue UI input of kind 3 key 262 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition (view's selection's caret = 4) reporting "The replaced source lost Unicode navigation"
set the text of "Source" in (the address of instance) to "éx"
queue UI input of kind 4 key 0 at 0.0 0.0 with modifiers 0 containing "!" in (the address of view)
ignore update UI view (the address of view)
require condition ((the UI value for (the control labeled "Source" in (the address of instance)) in (the address of instance))'s text = "éx!") reporting "Queued input after replacement used an old text offset"
close the address of view
close the address of instance
print line "Source replacements preserve Unicode caret boundaries before input and paint."
